{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Awesome Mnemonics - Quick Reference Card\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Print this page for your desk or on-call kit}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\i Release v2.5 \u8212- 2026-01-25}\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u55357 ?\u57000 ? CRISIS RESPONSE (Production Down)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b STOP \u8594 ? TRACE \u8594 ? DEBUG \u8594 ? 8D}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b STOP} (2-5 min) - S - Step back - T - Take a deep breath - O - Observe what is happening - P - Pull back and put things in perspective\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b TRACE} (Network/System) - T - Test connectivity - R - Review logs and metrics - A - Analyze packet captures - C - Check configurations - E - Escalate with documented evidence\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b DEBUG} (Analysis) - D - Define the problem - E - Examine error messages/logs - B - Break down into components - U - Understand data flow - G - Generate hypothesis and test\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b 8D Approach} (Resolution) - D1 - Form a team - D2 - Describe the problem - D3 - Interim Containment Action - D4 - Root Cause Analysis (use 5 Whys) - D5 - Permanent Corrective Actions - D6 - Implement & Validate - D7 - Prevent reoccurrence - D8 - Congratulate your team and close the loop (closure & celebration)\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u9889 ? QUICK DECISIONS\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b IDEA \u8594 ? DICE \u8594 ? FATE} (10-30 min)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b IDEA} - I - Identify problem - D - Develop Solution - E - Execute Solution - A - Assess Solution\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b DICE} (Check Blockers) - D - Delay - I - Incompetence - C - Conflict - E - External factors\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b FATE} (Resource Check) - F - Funding - A - Allocation of resources - T - Time - E - Expertise\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u55357 ?\u56421 ? CONFLICT RESOLUTION\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b WAIT \u8594 ? BREATHE \u8594 ? PAUSE \u8594 ? RACI} (5-20 min)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b WAIT} - \u8220"Why am I talking?\u8221" - Listen first\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b BREATHE} - B - Breathe deeply and slowly - R - Remain rational and listen - E - Empathize with the other person\u8217's problem - A - Ask questions to understand - T - Take a break if needed - H - Hold back from reacting - E - Express yourself calmly\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b PAUSE} - P - Put things in perspective - A - Acknowledge your feelings and theirs - U - Understand you don\u8217't have to react immediately - S - Step Away from the situation - E - Evaluate options and plan\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b RACI} (Clarify Roles) - R - Responsible (does the work) - A - Accountable (final approval) - C - Consulted (provides input) - I - Informed (kept updated)\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u55357 ?\u56589 ? ROOT CAUSE ANALYSIS\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b ICEBERG \u8594 ? 5 Whys \u8594 ? PADDER} (1-2 hours)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b ICEBERG} - I - Identify issue(s) - C - Collect data and analyze situation - E - Examine possible (root) causes - B - Brainstorm solutions - E - Execute solution(s) - R - Review, evaluate, and adjust solutions - G - Gather feedback\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b 5 Whys} - Keep asking \u8220"Why?\u8221" until root cause identified - Usually 3-5 iterations\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Ishikawa (Fishbone)} - State problem (head); choose categories (e.g.\u160 ?6 M\u8217's); brainstorm causes (bones); use 5 Whys on branches\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b A3 Problem Solving} - One-page: Background, Current state, Goal, Root cause (5 Whys/Ishikawa), Countermeasures, Plan\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b PADDER} - P - Pinpoint problem - A - Analyze data and look for patterns - D - Develop solution & consider other ways\u8212-try to have more than one option - D - Design action plan - E - Execute action plan & Monitor Results - R - Reevaluate and refine plan as needed\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u55357 ?\u56880 ? STRESS MANAGEMENT\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b PACE \u8594 ? ARIES \u8594 ? CALM} (10-15 min immediate, 2-4 weeks long-term)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b PACE} (Immediate) - P - Physical activity - A - Avoiding unhealthy behaviors - C - Coping skills - E - Emotional awareness\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b ARIES} (Lifestyle) - A - Avoid unnecessary stress - R - Relax and take breaks - I - Incorporate physical activity - E - Eat a healthy diet - S - Sleep well\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b CALM} (Mental Framework) - C - Confidence: Believe in your abilities - A - Awareness: Stay conscious of thoughts/feelings - L - Logic: Use rational thinking - M - Mindfulness: Practice being present\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u55356 ?\u57303 ?\u65039 ? INFRASTRUCTURE DESIGN\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b SCALE \u8594 ? SWOT \u8594 ? PESTEL \u8594 ? SET}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b SCALE} - S - Security by design - C - Capacity planning - A - Automation-first - L - Load balancing - E - Error handling/resilience\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b SWOT} (Evaluate Design) - S - Strengths - W - Weaknesses - O - Opportunities - T - Threats\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b PESTEL} (External Factors) - P - Political - E - Economic - S - Sociocultural - T - Technological - E - Environmental - L - Legal\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b SET Triangle} (Pick 2) - Good / Fast / Cheap - The third is what you won\u8217't get\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
