{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b TRACE} - T - Test connectivity (ping, traceroute) - R - Review logs and metrics - A - Analyze packet captures - C - Check configurations - E - Escalate with documented evidence\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u55357 ?\u56481 ? KEY PRINCIPLES\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab {\b Don\u8217't skip steps} - Each mnemonic builds on the previous one\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab {\b Document at each stage} - Your insights inform the next step\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab {\b Know when to branch} - If simple becomes complex, escalate\par}
